{"id":"vod_hh_70974","vodId":"70974","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"GS美神","name_cn":"GS美神","date":"1993-01-01","year":"1993","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第45集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/7ed5780e1570dee3b97151dbac7cadf1.jpg"},"summary":"从事驱魔行业的人叫做驱魔清道夫，简称——GS。《GS美神极乐大作战》讲述驱魔公司老板美神令子的神奇故事。美神令子是一个凭着顶级功力纵横驱魔界并爱钱如命的女孩子。不管是谁，都无法阻碍她降妖除魔和狂赚金钱。她有两个助手，一个是心地善良的小娟和工资低的近乎业务劳动兼且愚蠢好色的烦恼少年横岛忠夫。（这人的好色程度简直无以伦比，拿着255日元的时薪梦想以后娶美神本息双收）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-11-19 14:12:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":44,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yerlpg4b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel908ra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMVXEOb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2wXG1d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel908ga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDVxYye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8DgXgb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKVG5Ye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVVWJve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQ8X5Le/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAYr9Pa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepjnXNb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaO0GqLb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyvzMPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerlpgKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZ9gmRd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGVAg8b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第19集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej9BOld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20集","url":